# Subagent model

When launching any subagent (Task, explore, shell, review, Bugbot, security-review, or others), set the model to **Cursor Grok 4.6 High Fast**.

- Model slug: `cursor-grok-4.6-high-fast`
- Do not use Inherit, Composer, Grok 4.5, or any other agent model.
- Do not substitute a different model if this one is available.

See `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
